// Two imported files defining the same signature. Neither is the entry file, so
// there is no way to tell which one the author meant -- and the winner was
// previously decided by import order, silently.
//
// The failure this replaces was total but invisible: adding an unrelated
// `import` could swap out a function the program already relied on, and the call
// site showed no sign of it.

import "collide_a.ax";
import "collide_b.ax";

function main():void {
    print(shared(1));
    print("\n");
    eof: pass;
}
